    "name": "EmpireX - Business, Real Estate and Crime Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3719460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d024a1f718b4cd6c6f7ac144e8818c0e.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=626 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d024a1f718b4cd6c6f7ac144e8818c0e.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d024a1f718b4cd6c6f7ac144e8818c0e.mp4?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>EmpireX</strong> is a deep and immersive crime and business empire simulator where you start as a low-level street dealer and build your own criminal organization from scratch. Manage drug production, street sales, political connections, money laundering, real estate investments, and even relationships \u2014 all in a living city full of opportunity and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Climb your way to the top, or be crushed by the streets you're trying to rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddcd Create Your Character and Your Criminal Organization </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance and define your gang's identity and style. Choose whether to build a ruthless, violent crew or a silent and calculated operation. Your reputation shapes your path through the criminal underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/76d60d3696aa2ada87c6101791bf3d0a.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/76d60d3696aa2ada87c6101791bf3d0a.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/76d60d3696aa2ada87c6101791bf3d0a.mp4?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8a Buy, Sell, and Take Over the Streets </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy from local suppliers and sell directly to final customers on the streets. Build loyalty, increase profits, and take control of neighborhoods one by one. Compete with rival dealers and avoid drawing too much police attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/2165aa5dd3d0db0aae6e0b8f21be337e.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/2165aa5dd3d0db0aae6e0b8f21be337e.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 Explore the City and Gear Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase vehicles, weapons, and equipment to support your operations. Travel across the city, collect intel, run jobs, or simply show off your success. The streets are yours to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/8a0a398595e14cfd94b65fd10bb94736.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/8a0a398595e14cfd94b65fd10bb94736.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Real Estate &amp; Front Businesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your empire through smart property investments and strategic business ownership. Buy undervalued homes, renovate and flip or rent them for steady income \u2014 or turn them into stash houses for your operations. Open restaurants, gyms, or shops to generate legit revenue or use them as dirty fronts to launder money. Whether for profit or cover, buildings are more than bricks \u2014 they\u2019re power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/2ff7f913e3789f30c9fa2271544fd0b2.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=315 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/2ff7f913e3789f30c9fa2271544fd0b2.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Produce and Distribute </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up drug labs with basic tools or sophisticated equipment. Optimize your production, manage raw materials, and ensure your product reaches dealers or distributors on time and intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/032f39e65a7851423079bedf510693e6.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=315 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/032f39e65a7851423079bedf510693e6.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcca Manage Your Criminal Network </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle your frequent customers and dealers carefully. Don\u2019t be late, or you\u2019ll risk losing trust and reputation. A stable and loyal network is essential for long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/34164e79ff05510c6afa6a1877a5e792.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=379 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/34164e79ff05510c6afa6a1877a5e792.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude93 Escape or Confront the Police </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police will watch your every move. Raid operations, car chases, and surveillance increase as you rise. Choose whether to escape, bribe officials, or fight your way out of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d2607a802be75b0d50c5f4e18b3e6fc1.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=381 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d2607a802be75b0d50c5f4e18b3e6fc1.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcde Influence the Right People </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build connections with judges, politicians, and insiders. Unlock new features, get better prices, suppress investigations, or sway laws in your favor. Power often comes through who you know, not what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/6d45dc78c69072567e0d96baedb2a394.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/6d45dc78c69072567e0d96baedb2a394.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/6d45dc78c69072567e0d96baedb2a394.mp4?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b Robberies and High-Risk Jobs </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and execute robberies \u2014 armored trucks, stores, banks, and more. Organize your crew and take the risk, but be prepared: failure could cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/af58a3cc507682189bf22b8ee9d4cf42.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/af58a3cc507682189bf22b8ee9d4cf42.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/af58a3cc507682189bf22b8ee9d4cf42.mp4?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udcc8 Game Future</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More stores, clothes, guns, furniture's...\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and ammo production and distribution </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansion to new states and countries </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global drug and weapons trade operations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clothing, jewelry, and full appearance customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love and double life,\u00a0partner, date, even get married \u2014 all while hiding your criminal empire.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Launch planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are working hard and currently finishing some major mechanics and soon its ready we will launch the Alpha. <strong>The is that alpha will be release till end of June.</strong><br><br>   <br><strong>Access our discord for more information and devlog!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>EmpireX is a work of fiction with mature themes, adult language, and depictions of illegal activity. It does not promote or encourage real-world criminal behavior.</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d024a1f718b4cd6c6f7ac144e8818c0e.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=626 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d024a1f718b4cd6c6f7ac144e8818c0e.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d024a1f718b4cd6c6f7ac144e8818c0e.mp4?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>EmpireX</strong> is a deep and immersive crime and business empire simulator where you start as a low-level street dealer and build your own criminal organization from scratch. Manage drug production, street sales, political connections, money laundering, real estate investments, and even relationships \u2014 all in a living city full of opportunity and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Climb your way to the top, or be crushed by the streets you're trying to rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddcd Create Your Character and Your Criminal Organization </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance and define your gang's identity and style. Choose whether to build a ruthless, violent crew or a silent and calculated operation. Your reputation shapes your path through the criminal underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/76d60d3696aa2ada87c6101791bf3d0a.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/76d60d3696aa2ada87c6101791bf3d0