ront Businesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your empire through smart property investments and strategic business ownership. Buy undervalued homes, renovate and flip or rent them for steady income \u2014 or turn them into stash houses for your operations. Open restaurants, gyms, or shops to generate legit revenue or use them as dirty fronts to launder money. Whether for profit or cover, buildings are more than bricks \u2014 they\u2019re power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/2ff7f913e3789f30c9fa2271544fd0b2.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=315 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/2ff7f913e3789f30c9fa2271544fd0b2.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Produce and Distribute </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up drug labs with basic tools or sophisticated equipment. Optimize your production, manage raw materials, and ensure your product reaches dealers or distributors on time and intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/032f39e65a7851423079bedf510693e6.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=315 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/032f39e65a7851423079bedf510693e6.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcca Manage Your Criminal Network </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle your frequent customers and dealers carefully. Don\u2019t be late, or you\u2019ll risk losing trust and reputation. A stable and loyal network is essential for long-term success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/34164e79ff05510c6afa6a1877a5e792.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=379 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/34164e79ff05510c6afa6a1877a5e792.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude93 Escape or Confront the Police </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police will watch your every move. Raid operations, car chases, and surveillance increase as you rise. Choose whether to escape, bribe officials, or fight your way out of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d2607a802be75b0d50c5f4e18b3e6fc1.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=381 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/d2607a802be75b0d50c5f4e18b3e6fc1.webm?t=1748448614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcde Influence the Right People </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build connections with judges, politicians, and insiders. Unlock new features, get better prices, suppress investigations, or sway laws in your favor. Power often comes through who you know, not what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719460/extras/6d45dc78c69072567e0d96baedb2a394.poster.avif?t=1748448614\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item