hing some major mechanics and soon its ready we will launch the Alpha. <strong>The is that alpha will be release till end of June.</strong><br><br>   <br><strong>Access our discord for more information and devlog!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>EmpireX is a work of fiction with mature themes, adult language, and depictions of illegal activity. It does not promote or encourage real-world criminal behavior.</strong></i></p>",
