        "notes": "EmpireX is a simulation game intended for mature audiences. It revolves around building a criminal empire and contains sensitive content that may not be suitable for all players. The game includes the following elements:\r\n\r\nCrime-related themes: Players manage a criminal organization involved in drug trafficking, money laundering, corruption, and theft.\r\n\r\nDrug and alcohol use: The game features representations of drug production, sale, and consumption as part of its gameplay.\r\n\r\nImplied violence: While the game includes heists, confrontations, and risky situations, these are presented through text and static or symbolic images \u2014 with no graphic depictions of violence or gore.\r\n\r\nMild sexual and suggestive content: Some storylines involve romantic relationships and double lives, but there is no nudity or depiction of sexual acts.\r\n\r\nStrong language: Dialogues and descriptions may include mature or offensive language.\r\n\r\nThis game does not promote or condone real-life illegal or immoral behavior and is a fictional interactive experience with mature themes."
